  "question": {
    "text": "Three rods of identical cross-sectional area and made from the same metal form the sides of an isosceles triangle <em><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>ABC</mi></math></em> right angled at <em><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math></em>. The points <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math>&nbsp;are maintained at temperatures <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>T</mi></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi>T</mi></math>, respectively, in the steady-state. Assuming that only heat conduction takes place, the temperature of the point&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math> is<br />\r<br />\r<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/EM0026604_question.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width: 144px; height: 123px;\" />",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "JTi78",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>T</mi></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "jCaqY",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>T</mi><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "Kybp9",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>T</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mfenced><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "B1jOZ",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>T</mi><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "image": null,
