  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "As T<sub>B</sub> &gt; T<sub>A</sub>, heat flows from <em>B</em> to <em>A</em> through both paths <em>BA</em> and <em>BCA</em>.<br />Rate of heat flow in BC = Rate of heat flow in CA<br /><br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>K</mi><mi>A</mi><mfenced><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi>T</mi><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>c</mtext></msub></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mi>l</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">KA</mtext><mfenced><mrow><msub><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">T</mtext><mtext>c</mtext></msub><mo>-</mo><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">T</mtext></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi>l</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br />Solving this, we get&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>c</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>T</mi></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <u><strong><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/EM0026604_Ans.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width: 154px; height: 164px;\" /></strong></u>",
